         ("Give the ordered NSAID for her abdominal cramps without raising a query", False, "An NSAID narrows the vessel entering the glomerulus. Every kidney-toxic medicine is questioned in a patient at risk."),
         ("Track urine output, weight, and fluid balance, and query kidney-toxic medicines", True, "Age over 65, diabetes, and chronic kidney disease are susceptibilities, and volume loss is an exposure. The bundle is measurement, accurate balance, kidney function checks, medication review, and early reporting."),
